type: software
title: "Execution Governance Model (EGM)"
version: "3.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
url: "https://github.com/GraceAdjeliGRCAI/execution-governance-model"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GraceAdjeliGRCAI/execution-governance-model"
abstract: >
  The Execution Governance Model (EGM) is the first formally specified and
  adversarially verified runtime governance framework for AI systems. EGM
  closes the gap between AI governance policy and enforceable runtime
  controls by embedding governance enforcement directly into AI execution.
  Version 3.0 establishes six formally specified governance guarantees,
  verified through 57 adversarial tests and 21 conformance checks, and maps
  each guarantee to corresponding requirements in NIST SP 800-53, the OWASP
  AI Security Top 10, ISO/IEC 42001, the EU AI Act, and the NIST AI RMF.
